{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16605","headline":"同清江师月夜听坚正二上人爲怀州转法华经歌 · 朱湾","name":"同清江师月夜听坚正二上人爲怀州转法华经歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"若耶谿畔云门僧，夜闲燕坐听真乘。\n莲花秘偈药草喻，二师身住口不住。\n凿井求泉会到源，闭门避火终迷路。\n前心後心皆此心，梵音妙音柔软音。\n清泠霜磬有时动，寂历空堂宜夜深。\n向来不寐何所事，一念才生百虑息。\n风翻乱叶林有声，雪映闲庭月无色。\n玄关密迹难可思，醒人悟兮醉人疑。\n衣中系宝觉者谁，临川内史字得之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱湾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16605.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16605","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}